// Title: File Download Using ProtocolHandler.exe
// Sigma ID: 104cdb48-a7a8-4ca7-a453-32942c6e5dcb
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2021-07-13 | Modified: 2023-11-09
// ATT&CK: stealth, T1218
// Description: Detects usage of "ProtocolHandler" to download files. Downloaded files will be located in the
//   cache folder (for example - %LOCALAPPDATA%\Microsoft\Windows\INetCache\IE)
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/f339e7da7d05f6057fdfcdd3742bfcf365fee2a9/atomics/T1218/T1218.md
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/OtherMSBinaries/ProtocolHandler/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_protocolhandler_download.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "\\protocolhandler.exe" or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "ProtocolHandler.exe") and (ProcessCommandLine contains "ftp://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "http://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "https://")
